/01/Gym-VARA6FF.png\" alt=\"\" />																</p>\n<h6>Fitness center</h6>\n<p>Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur.</p>\n<p>															<img width=\"80\" height=\"80\" src=\"http://127.0.0.1/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/Coffee-maker-VARA6FF.png\" alt=\"\" />																</p>\n<h6>Coffee maker</h6>\n<p>Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur.</p>\n<p>							SPECIAL OFFERS</p>\n<h2>unforgettable deals for a luxurious stay experience</h2>\n<h6><a href=\"#\">Weekend deals</a></h6>\n<p>Up to 25% off</p>\n<h5><a href=\"#\">Family package</a></h5>\n<p>Up to 25% off</p>\n<h5><a href=\"#\">Holiday special</a></h5>\n<p>Up to 25% off</p>\n<h5><a href=\"#\">Summer getaway</a></h5>\n<p>Up to 25% off</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/VhBl3dHT5SY?feature=oembed?playlist=VhBl3dHT5SY&amp;mute=0&amp;autoplay=0&amp;loop=no&amp;controls=0&amp;start=0&amp;end=\" aria-label=\"video-popup\"><br />\n			</a></p>\n<p>\"At Luxora, we believe that true luxury is found not only in our stunning surroundings but in the personalized experience we offer to every guest.\"</p>\n<p>										<strong>Alexander Montgomery</strong><br />\n										Founder Luxora<br />\n							GUEST REVIEWS					</p>\n<h2>Hear what our satisfied guest say about us</h2>\n<p>\"The attention to detail was impeccable, and the staff made our stay feel like a dream. Luxora is the ultimate luxury experience.\"</p>\n<p>											<img width=\"72\" height=\"72\" src=\"http://127.0.0.1/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/woman-at-spa-J3SFDRR.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://127.0.0.1/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/woman-at-spa-J3SFDRR.jpg 1200w, http://127.0.0.1/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/woman-at-spa-J3SFDRR-300x300.jpg 300w, http://127.0.0.1/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/woman-at-spa-J3SFDRR-1024x1024.jpg 1024w, http://127.0.0.1/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/woman-at-spa-J3SFDRR-150x150.jpg 150w, http://127.0.0.1/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/woman-at-spa-J3SFDRR-768x768.jpg 768w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" /><br />\n										<strong>Sarah Thompson</strong><br />\n										Marketing Director</p>\n<p>\"The attention to detail was impeccable, and the staff made our stay feel like a dream. Luxora is the ultimate luxury experience.\"</p>\n<p>											<img width=\"72\" height=\"72\" src=\"http://127.0.0.1/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/young-man-at-a-rooftop-party-smiling-to-camera-PQWRG7P.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://127.0.0.1/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/young-man-at-a-rooftop-party-smiling-to-camera-PQWRG7P.jpg 1200w, http://127.0.0.1/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/young-man-at-a-rooftop-party-smiling-to-camera-PQWRG7P-300x300.jpg 300w, http://127.0.0.1/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/young-man-at-a-rooftop-party-smiling-to-camera-PQWRG7P-1024x1024.jpg 1024w, http://127.0.0.1/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/young-man-at-a-rooftop-party-smiling-to-camera-PQWRG7P-150x150.jpg 150w, http://127.0.0.1/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/young-man-at-a-rooftop-party-smiling-to-camera-PQWRG7P-768x768.jpg 768w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" /><br />\n										<strong>James Harrison</strong><br />\n										Software Engineer</p>\n<p>\"The attention to detail was impeccable, and the staff made our stay feel like a dream. Luxora is the ultimate luxury experience.\"</p>\n<p>											<img width=\"72\" height=\"72\" src=\"http://127.0.0.1/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/pleased-patient-sitting-at-the-enquiry-counter-PC6HV3C.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://127.0.0.1/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/pleased-patient-sitting-at-the-enquiry-counter-PC6HV3C.jpg 1200w, http://127.0.0.1/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/pleased-patient-sitting-at-the-enquiry-counter-PC6HV3C-300x300.jpg 300w, http://127.0.0.1/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/pleased-patient-sitting-at-the-enquiry-counter-PC6HV3C-1024x1024.jpg 1024w, http://127.0.0.1/wordpress/wp-content/uplo